156 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 130 0 R
/E (               This work investigates impact of PV integration on the end buses - Bus 675,680,611 and 652 on voltage profile and power losses in a distribution system. A PV system with a solar generation profile was installed at those buses identified as weak buses due to its long distance from the substation, higher line impedance, and large loading. The results demonstrate an improvement in voltage levels of and decrease in line losses due to reduced current on the integration of PV on Bus 675 compared to other buses)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
